The Volkswagen Polo GTI is the performance variant of the standard Polo hatchback. The most recent version is part of the Mk6 generation, which received a facelift in 2021. It is powered by a 2.0-liter turbocharged engine and is primarily available with a DSG automatic transmission. It sits on a lowered sports suspension and features distinctive GTI styling cues.

